{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2017-818", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/818", "wordCount": 1867, "segments": [{"start": 21.0, "text": "I'm sure many of us here have"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "found ourselves in this"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "situation."}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "You're in the bathtub, and you"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "come up with an amazing idea for"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "Or perhaps a little bit less"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "relaxing, you get a text message"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "from someone very important in"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "your organization asking you to"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "come up with amazing ideas for a"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "new app. Looks like we are going to be"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "looking at Timers today."}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "So in those situations, you"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "might tell yourself, \"I don't"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "have time.\""}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "You might want to dive into X"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "code, start typing out some"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "Swift, but the problem with that"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "is that once you get committed"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "to code, you're really deep into"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "how your app is going to work,"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "and you don't get much leeway to"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "explore all the alternatives"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "that you could."}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "Or you might want to dive into"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "Sketch, and draw some really"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "detailed visuals."}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "But again, the problem with that"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "is that visuals are not"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "interactive."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "We're building apps."}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "We want to try it as if it were"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "a real app."}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "So let me show you something I"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "may build after getting my CEO"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "asking for a Timer."}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "This is a very basic concept."}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "I tap to add five seconds to the"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "timer. Let's make it 10."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "I press Start, and it starts"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "counting down to zero."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "Nothing fancy here, just an idea"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "I had about how the Timer app"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "might look."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "Now, as you might have guessed,"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "from the title of this talk,"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "this is not a real app."}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "It's a prototype, and it only"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "took me 60 seconds to build."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "That is less time than it took"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "you to brush your teeth this"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "morning...hopefully ."}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "So why do we build prototypes?"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "We build prototypes to test"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "ideas."}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "Some things that seem really"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "great might turn out to be not"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "so great once you try it."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "And some things that don't"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "appear very good at first might"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "actually have some very valuable"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "insights to them."}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "This is about saving time and"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "money by making sure that when"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "you commit to building something"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "by writing code, designing"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "assets, you're building the"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "right thing."}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "We also make prototypes to get"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "new ideas."}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "The act of making prototypes and"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "showing them to people will"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "bring new insights that will"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "help make your product even"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "better."}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "Designers love diagrams, so here"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "is a diagram of what the"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "prototyping process might look"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "like."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "We make prototypes, we show them"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "to people, and we learn from the"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "feedback. And we do this over and over and"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "over again, until we know we're"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "really making the right thing."}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "So let's start by making a"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "prototype."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "Who can make prototypes?"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "Everyone. It is about using"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "tools that you already use every"}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "day. If you are a developer, you"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "might use X code in Swift, or"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "HTML, CSS, and JavaScript."}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "If you are a designer, you might"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "use Sketch or Illustrator."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "But even if you don't code or"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "design, you can build"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "prototypes."}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "You can use keynotes, or your"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "favorite text processor."}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "It's about subverting your"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "tools."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "Use tools that you use already"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "every day, and push them in new"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "ways."}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "If it can display images, and"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "respond to user interaction, you"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "can probably build prototypes"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "with it."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "So let me show you how I built"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "the prototype we just saw"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "earlier, just using Keynotes, in"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "under 60 seconds."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Now, the video you're about to"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "see is a little fast, because I"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "like to use Keynote a lot for"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "that kind of stuff, but let me"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "get you through it."}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "So I start by making my document"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "the size of an iPhone."}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "And I'm going to draw the clock"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "face for my timer."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "You'll notice I'm not using"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "really fancy design assets, I'm"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "just using basic Keynote shapes."}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "Let's do the same thing for the"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "button, the Start button."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "Again, just using a basic"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "Keynote shape."}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "Let's make it green."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "And let's make it say Start."}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "Now, I'm adding the hand for my"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "timer."}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "The trick I'm going to use is in"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "Keynote, when you rotate"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "objects, they rotate around"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "their center."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "So here, you see I am"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "copy/pasting the hand, moving it"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "to the lower part, and making it"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "invisible."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "Now, I can group them and I can"}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "rotate it and it will look just"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "like a hand on the timer would."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "So we make it rotate to the 5"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "second mark for the first tap,"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "no easing to make it look just"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "like a real clock, and we add"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "another animation for the 10"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "second mark."}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "And finally, the last animation,"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "which is the hand of the timer"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "rotating all the way back to the"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "0 second mark."}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "And as this animation starts, we"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "make the Start button disappear."}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "And that's it."}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "Just like that, we have a"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "prototype that we can load on an"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "iPhone, and have it look just"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "like a real app."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "So now that we've made a"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "prototype, we show it to people."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "As we show it to people, we ask"}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "ourselves, how can we make it"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "better? I have some theories about what"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "will work and what won't, and"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "look for evidence that supports"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "or contradicts those theories."}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "Don't argue, defend, or dismiss"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "the feedback you get."}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "It is also very important to"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "show your prototypes in context,"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "on the device they're meant for,"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "in a somewhat realistic"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "situation."}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "You can't test things in a"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "vacuum."}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "So, for example, here I ask my"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "co-worker to test the pH of a"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "little bit of water, using the"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "timer. So we add the pH reagent, press"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "the Start button, and start"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "shaking the test tube for 10"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "seconds."}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "So in this case, it seems to"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "work pretty well, right?"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "Like, it is not a very"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "complicated use case."}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "Maybe it would be nice to have"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "the Timer flash, or play a sound"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "at the end, but it seems to work"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "pretty well."}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "Now, my friend David used to be"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "really good at solving the"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "Rubik's Cube in high school, so"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "I asked him to see if he could"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "still solve a Rubik's Cube in"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "under 10 seconds."}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "Looks like he's still got it,"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "with time to spare, too"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "Now, as David was using this,"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "there are a number of things"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "that he was telling me."}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "He found that the Start button"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "was a little small, and hard to"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "tap."}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "He also thought it would be nice"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "if there was a countdown when"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "you press Start, so he could"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "really position himself on the"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "Rubik's Cube, and he really"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "wanted to see the actual precise"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "time, so he could tell if he"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "beat his record or not."}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "You see that this opens up a lot"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "of interesting design questions"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "around what we're building, and"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "what it should be like."}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "Once we've shown our prototypes,"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "we take a moment to step back"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "and learn from the feedback that"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "we have gathered."}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "What is working?"}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "What is not working?"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "Do we refine what we have?"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "Or do we try something else"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "altogether?"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "Perhaps do some brainstorming to"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "come up with the next steps?"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "For example, here are some of"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "the questions that we got as we"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "showed our prototype."}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "Do we display the time left on"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "the timer, or the time elapsed?"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "How do you pause or stop the"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "timer?"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "Should we show the time in"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "digital form or analog form, or"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "maybe both?"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "And are we building a generic"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "timer, or one for a very"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "specific purpose, like solving"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "Rubik's Cubes?"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "And many, many other questions."}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "Now, the goal isn't to answer"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "all of those questions, but"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "rather to know what you don't"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "know, so you can then"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "strategically choose what to"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "pursue next."}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "Here is how I might improve this"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "prototype after showing it."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "So, David told me that the Start"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "button was small, and the Clock"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "was hard to see, so I agree with"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "him. I'm going to make it a nice,"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "bold red, and let's make the"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "hand white, just so that it"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "really stands out."}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "Start button is too small, so"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "let's do away with it"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "altogether, and maybe we make"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "the entire lower portion of"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "this, creating a tap region."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "And let's make it say Start in"}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "nice, bold letters."}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "Same color as the clock to keep"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "it consistent."}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "And I'm going to add a finish"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "screen for my timer, so we know"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "the timer is done counting down."}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "So I just add a new slide that"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "we navigate to automatically and"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "have it say Timer Done."}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "And just like that, we have a"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "new iteration of our prototype,"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "that we can build on, and show"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "to people."}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "Making things fast lets you"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "quickly explore a very wide"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "range of ideas and directions."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "Here are some more prototypes"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "that I built in Keynote around"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "the concept of the Timer."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "Now, some of them, as you see,"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "are aesthetic explorations"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "around what a Timer might look"}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "like, or how you might interact"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "with it, while others are more"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "specific use cases."}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "Timers for developing film or"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "cooking a steak."}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "That is also where having a very"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "diverse team helps your process"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "a lot. It will let you stumble upon"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "things you never would have on"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "your own."}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "For example, my co-worker made"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "this Timer to help their child"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "brush their teeth."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "So we make quick interactive"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "prototypes."}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "We show them to people."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "And we learn from the feedback."}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "And we do this over, and over,"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "and over again, until we know"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "we're doing the right thing."}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "If you start by making one"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "thing, you'll be inspired to"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "make a few others."}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "Some of these things will work"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "really well, and the ideas will"}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "make it mostly unchanged"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "throughout your prototyping process, and on to your final"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "product."}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "Most things will have some"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "aspects that work, and others"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "that don't work as well."}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "You will be able to take those"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "and modify them and recombine"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "them in new prototypes that you"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "can show and explore."}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "And finally, a few things won't"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "work at all, and it is great"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "when that happens."}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "You've just learned something"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "very valuable about your app,"}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "and you're not going to be"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "spending designing time or"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "programming time building things"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "that would not have worked out."}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "The goal is to take ideas from"}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "your head into the real world,"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "on device, in context, in front"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "of people, as fast as possible."}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "As you are leaving WWDC later"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "today, here are a few things you"}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "can do."}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "If you don't make prototypes"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "already, the next time you have"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "an idea for an app, or future"}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "for your app, make prototypes."}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "Show them to your colleagues."}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "If you already make prototypes,"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "amazing!"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "Wonderful!"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "Find co-workers who don't, and"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "show them how you do it."}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "And if you manage a team, make"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "sure that you're building the"}, {"start": 616.0, "text": "right thing, by making time for"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "prototyping as part of your"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "process and culture."}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "Imagine how wonderful it would"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "be if the next time you get a"}, {"start": 626.0, "text": "text message like this from your"}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "CEO, you can reply just 60"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "seconds later with a prototype"}, {"start": 631.0, "text": "like this."}]}
